Two transactions load the same version. One commits first. What happens when the other flushes a stale update?

Environment: Extend the previous Spring API project with Spring Data JPA, PostgreSQL, and Flyway. Configure a local database and a migration before running repository operations. This fragment demonstrates the versioned model.

```java
// Entity fragment in a Spring Data JPA project; imports: jakarta.persistence.*
@Entity
class ExpenseEntity {
  @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
  Long id;
  @Version Long version;
  String label;
  int amount;
  protected ExpenseEntity() {}
}
```
